  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "Bob Lazar, a man who says he worked at S4, a secret site in the Nevada desert, says that in 1989 he made trips out near Groom Lake, the dry lakebed by the secret base, and that the first time, the people there did not know they were out there. On the last trip, he says, they were caught, and he was banned from S4. Lazar tells it to Michels as his own experience, and it is, in his account, how his time at the site ended."
